            "value" : "无法读取此图书的文本，因此无法将其朗读为音频文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This braille looks like English Braille, American Edition. Choose its Braille Code in Book Information." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What Book Information says under the pop-up of a braille book that is read as UEB but whose braille shows English Braille, American Edition's signs (BrailleCodeDetector): which code it looks like and where to choose it. Plain, so that VoiceOver and a braille display read it as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "يبدو برايل هذا مثل برايل الإنجليزي (الطبعة الأمريكية). اختر رمز برايل الخاص به في معلومات الكتاب."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Braille sieht aus wie English Braille, American Edition. Wähle den Braille-Code in den Buchinformationen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este braille parece braille inglés, edición estadounidense. Elige su código braille en Información del libro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ce braille ressemble à du braille anglais, édition américaine. Choisissez son code braille dans Informations sur le livre."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "यह ब्रेल English Braille, American Edition जैसा लगता है। पुस्तक की जानकारी में इसका ब्रेल कोड चुनें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Braille ini tampak seperti English Braille, American Edition. Pilih Kode Braille-nya di Informasi Buku."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Questo braille sembra English Braille, American Edition. Scegli il suo Codice braille in Informazioni sul libro."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "この点字は English Braille, American Edition のようです。「ブック情報」で点字コードを選択してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "이 점자는 영어 점자 미국판과 비슷해 보입니다. 책 정보에서 점자 코드를 선택하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este braille parece braille inglês, edição americana. Escolha o código braille dele em Informações do livro."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Этот Брайль похож на английский Брайль, американское издание. Выберите его код в разделе «Сведения о книге»."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Цей брайль схожий на English Braille, American Edition. Виберіть його «Код Брайля» у вікні «Інформація про книгу»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "此盲文看起来像 English Braille, American Edition。请在“图书信息”中选取其盲文码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This comic book archive holds more than the %@ pictures TextMouth reads." : {
      "comment" : "Why a comic book archive was refused at import: it holds more pictures than TextMouth reads. %@ is the limit, already formatted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Comic-Archiv enthält mehr als die %@ Bilder, die TextMouth liest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo de cómic contiene más de las %@ imágenes que TextMouth lee."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Cette archive de bande dessinée contient plus de %@ images, le maximum que TextMouth lit."
