    "Warning: This will rewrite the library's copy of the EPUB file and recalculate its MD5 hash." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the warning shown under the metadata editor's switch while it is on. MD5 is the name of a checksum and stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "تحذير: سيؤدي هذا إلى إعادة كتابة نسخة المكتبة من ملف EPUB وإعادة حساب تجزئة MD5 الخاصة به."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Warnung: Dadurch wird die Kopie der EPUB-Datei in der Bibliothek neu geschrieben und ihr MD5-Hash neu berechnet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Advertencia: esto reescribirá la copia de la biblioteca del archivo EPUB y recalculará su hash MD5."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Attention : cela réécrira la copie du fichier EPUB de la bibliothèque et recalculera son empreinte MD5."
