    "While TextMouth was copying its data, %@ was changed to lead to %@ instead of %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a move of the data directory did not finish: the new location's link was changed while the data was copied. %1$@ is the link's path; %2$@ is where it leads now; %3$@ is where it led before.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "أثناء نسخ TextMouth لبياناته، تم تغيير %@ ليؤدي إلى %@ بدلًا من %@."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth ডেটা কপি করার সময় %1$@-কে %3$@-এর বদলে %2$@-এ নিয়ে যাওয়ার মতো করে বদলানো হয়েছে।"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Während TextMouth seine Daten kopierte, wurde %1$@ so geändert, dass es zu %2$@ statt zu %3$@ führt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
