    "the audiobook's audio changed since it was transcribed, so its transcript no longer fits it." : {
      "comment" : "Reason after a colon: an audiobook's audio changed after it was transcribed, so its transcript no longer fits; begins in lower case.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "تغيّر صوت الكتاب الصوتي منذ تفريغه، لذا لم تعد نسخته النصية مناسبة له."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "das Audio des Hörbuchs hat sich seit der Transkription geändert, daher passt sein Transkript nicht mehr dazu."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "el audio del audiolibro cambió desde que se transcribió, así que su transcripción ya no le corresponde."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "l’audio du livre audio a changé depuis sa transcription, donc sa transcription ne lui correspond plus."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "ऑडियोबुक का ऑडियो ट्रांसक्राइब किए जाने के बाद बदल गया, इसलिए उसका ट्रांसक्रिप्ट अब उससे मेल नहीं खाता।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "audio buku audio berubah sejak ditranskripsikan, sehingga transkripnya tidak lagi cocok."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "l’audio dell’audiolibro è cambiato dopo la trascrizione, quindi la sua trascrizione non gli corrisponde più."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "文字起こし後にオーディオブックのオーディオが変更されたため、文字起こしがオーディオに合わなくなりました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "오디오북의 오디오가 대본을 만든 이후 변경되어 대본이 더 이상 맞지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
